===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc}} {{term|διαλεκτική|tr=dialektike||the art of argument through interactive questioning and answering}}, from {{term|διαλεκτικός|tr=dialektikos||competent debater}}, from {{term|διαλέγομαι|tr=dialegomai||to participate in a [[dialogue]]}}, from {{term|διά|tr=dia||inter, through}} + {{term|λέγειν|tr=legein||to speak}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{plural of|[[dialectic]]}}
# A [[systematic]] method of [[argument]] that attempts to [[resolve]] the [[contradiction]]s in [[opposing]] [[view]]s or [[idea]]s.

